{"channelId":"UCdCz74CUaLv8YnNhcRyACOw","row":["mastersonmethod",108734,"The Masterson Method - Integrated Equine Performance Bodywork, is a unique, interactive method of equine massage and bodywork in which you learn to recognize and use the responses of the horse to your touch to find and release accumulated tension in key junctions of the body that most affect performance. In contrast to most traditional modalities, it enables the horse to actively participate in the process of releasing tension. It is something you do with the horse, rather than to the horse. This participation and interaction is what makes the method fascinating for those who use it. In fact, if you do not allow the horse to participate, it does not work!","courses@mastersonmethod.com","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCdCz74CUaLv8YnNhcRyACOw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCdCz74CUaLv8YnNhcRyACOw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T08:54:15.468Z"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCdCz74CUaLv8YnNhcRyACOw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T08:54:15.468Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"facebook","url":"https://www.facebook.com/mastersonmethod","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":108734,"raw":"108,734","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.facebook.com/MastersonMethod/","observedAt":"2026-09-17T05:58:09.435Z"},{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCdCz74CUaLv8YnNhcRyACOw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":28100,"raw":"28.1K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCdCz74CUaLv8YnNhcRyACOw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:21.043Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"courses@mastersonmethod.com","purpose":"unknown","ownerRole":"unknown","identityStatus":"channel_published","sourceUrls":["https://mastersonmethod.com/contact/"],"evidenceIds":["public-page:6835a13c6cffbca4a5aac43d"],"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:18:17.940Z","deliveryVerified":false,"dn